        "ContentType": "emails",
        "Topic": "\u0110\u1ED3 d\u00F9ng",
        "SourceType": "original-20261114",
        "PreviewText": "Email c\u1EA3m \u01A1n b\u1EA1n v\u00E0 h\u1EB9n tr\u1EA3 l\u1EA1i chi\u1EBFc \u00F4 \u0111\u00E3 m\u01B0\u1EE3n.",
        "IsPublished": true
      },
      "references": {}
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella.1d84306a62764f2b8e67d123913dd412",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u00ECnh \u0111\u00E3 \u0111\u1EC3 \u00F4 m\u1EDF cho kh\u00F4 \u1EDF nh\u00E0 t\u1ED1i qua.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "I left the umbrella open to dry at home last night.",
        "BreakAfter": true
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella.231971bd1fa84cf89b82e1079ea8bf17",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "VietnameseText": "M\u00ECnh s\u1EBD \u0111\u1EE3i b\u1EA1n \u1EDF c\u1ED5ng ch\u00EDnh l\u00FAc b\u1ED1n gi\u1EDD.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "I will wait for you at the main gate at four.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella.26650c52230442c583c62eff14716fc3",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 7,
        "VietnameseText": "N\u1EBFu b\u1EA1n b\u1EADn, m\u00ECnh c\u00F3 th\u1EC3 mang \u00F4 \u0111\u1EBFn nh\u00E0 b\u1EA1n.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "If you are busy, I can bring it to your house.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella.2c1cccde5b244699982773ddeda1a0b3",
      "kind": "WritingExerciseSentence",
      "values": {
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "VietnameseText": "Nh\u1EDD chi\u1EBFc \u00F4 c\u1EE7a b\u1EA1n, s\u00E1ch c\u1EE7a m\u00ECnh v\u1EABn kh\u00F4 r\u00E1o.",
        "EnglishMeaning": "Your umbrella kept my books dry.",
        "BreakAfter": false
      },
      "references": {
        "WritingExerciseId": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "team.writing.20261114.beginner.return-umbrella.543d388577ef41828a9e98e7afee09d4",
      "kind": "WritingAcceptedAnswer",
      "values": {
        "AnswerText": "I will wait at the main gate for you at four.",
